  KEYS: HOME (the start screen: what asks you, sessions with their state, then …
  ↑/k, ↓/j              move through the list; the preview on the right
                        follows
  g/home, G/end         first row, last row
  tab, shift+tab        the next or previous row that needs you (a waiting
                        session, a new answer, a question, a dead letter);
