  /                     filter by text (enter keeps it, esc clears it)
  :                     command prompt: ask, tell, prompt, answer, retry,
                        cancel, open, agent, filter, read, inbox, digest,
                        dashboard, help, quit; tab completes commands, agents
                        and intents, ↑/↓ choose, enter runs, esc closes
  esc                   clear the agent and the filter
  z                     hide or show the quiet sessions (idle, answer read)
  enter                 open the thread of the message, the run of a running
